{"4859340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "krizgame", "steam_appid": 4859340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>krizgame</strong>. You have <strong>one chance to beat it</strong>. Once you reach an end, you<strong> cannot enter the game again.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There are no second chances.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4859340/extras/545ed92d70661e4ad43548303cb2c3eb.poster.avif?t=1787865976\" aria-label=\"A row of deactivated screens, each one with a red light at the top right of them.\" width=1170 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4859340/extras/545ed92d70661e4ad43548303cb2c3eb.webm?t=1787865976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4859340/extras/545ed92d70661e4ad43548303cb2c3eb.mp4?t=1787865976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is the gameplay? How do I win?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each puzzle is basically their own game, and you must beat all the puzzles in order to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your time to learn each one of their gimmicks. Some might be more complicated than others.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4859340/extras/6b4278e9c93ad4b071833914d746ad7c.poster.avif?t=1787865976\" aria-label=\"A puzzle screen that has the text on it jumbled up. You can&#039;t tell what puzzle this is.\" width=1170 height=482 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4859340/extras/6b4278e9c93ad4b071833914d746ad7c.webm?t=1787865976\